                <div>
                    <h3 style="color: #2d3748; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Key Concepts:</h3>
                    <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.8;">
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start;">
                            <span style="color: #667eea; margin-right: 0.5rem;">•</span>
                            Supervised vs unsupervised learning
                        </li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start;">
                            <span style="color: #667eea; margin-right: 0.5rem;">•</span>
                            Decision trees and classification
                        </li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start;">
                            <span style="color: #667eea; margin-right: 0.5rem;">•</span>
                            Reinforcement learning basics
                        </li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start;">
                            <span style="color: #667eea; margin-right: 0.5rem;">•</span>
                            Neural network fundamentals
                        </li>
