                        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Bias:</strong> Ensuring AI systems are fair and unbiased</li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Safety:</strong> Implementing fail-safes and human oversight</li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Privacy:</strong> Protecting user data and maintaining privacy</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <h3 style="color: #2d3748; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Real-World Applications</h3>
                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem;">
